  "result": "I fixed the bug in `src/cart.js`, and `npm test` now passes (243 of 243).\n\n`total()` was applying tax before the discount. Per the comment in that file, the discount should come off the pre-tax subtotal and tax should apply to what's left. That ordering caused both failures: the fixed discount came off after tax, and a fixed discount larger than the subtotal could take the total negative.\n\nI changed it to apply the discount first, clamp the result at zero with `Math.max(0, …)`, then apply tax and round. I didn't touch the tests.",
